// Flutter web merges each card into one semantics group whose aria-label
// carries every line ("B\nBob\nactive\nDeveloper ┬À bob@e2e.test\nuser"), so the
// name is matched inside that label rather than as a standalone text node.
async function memberCard(name) {
  const rect = await evaluate(send, `(() => {
    const re = new RegExp('(^|\\\\n)' + ${JSON.stringify(name)} + '(\\\\n|$)');
    for (const el of document.querySelectorAll('flt-semantics[role="group"]')) {
      if (!re.test(el.getAttribute('aria-label') || '')) continue;
      const r = el.getBoundingClientRect();
      if (r.width && r.height) return { x: r.x, y: r.y, w: r.width, h: r.height };
    }
    return null;
  })()`);
  assert(rect, `Member card not found: ${name}`);
  return rect;
}

