Lifecycle transitions must be valid: resumed -> inactive -> hidden -> paused, and paused -> hidden -> inactive -> resumed. In test, start state is resumed. Use:

```dart
tester.binding.handleAppLifecycleStateChanged(AppLifecycleState.inactive);
tester.binding.handleAppLifecycleStateChanged(AppLifecycleState.hidden);
tester.binding.handleAppLifecycleStateChanged(AppLifecycleState.paused);
// change role
tester.binding.handleAppLifecycleStateChanged(AppLifecycleState.hidden);
tester.binding.handleAppLifecycleStateChanged(AppLifecycleState.inactive);
tester.binding.handleAppLifecycleStateChanged(AppLifecycleState.resumed);
```

But currentUser refresh should happen at resumed. Put api.me change before the resume sequence. Let's patch.

